{
    "version": 6,
    "bundle": "7TUDTB6YO33E2H5KM7NGBNPZQ4SJSODG",
    "type": "story",
    "storyId": "801105002",
    "title": "“観測者”との遭遇",
    "enTitle": "Encounter With an Observer",
    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "映画を観た帰りに公園を通ったところ、\nネオユニヴァースの姿を見かけた。",
            "enText": "Upon passing a park on my way home \nfrom a movie, I notice Neo Universe \nstanding there.",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "origClipLength": 90,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "pathId": -5027655496008127678,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ネオユニヴァース",
            "enName": "Neo Universe",
            "jpText": "……“CONT”……届いたよ。\nネオユニヴァースは、『うれしい』だよ……。",
            "enText": "…CONT… All received. \nNeo Universe is… Pleased.",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "origClipLength": 93,
            "voiceIdx": 61,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 133,
                    "pathId": -7166236897702679174
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 140,
                    "pathId": 3814207013405799294
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -4389496107596021702,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "何をしているかはよくわからないが……\n寮の門限まで1時間を切る頃だ。\nひと声かけて行くことにする。",
            "enText": "I'm not quite sure what she's doing, but it's \nless than an hour until the dorm's curfew \nstarts, so I call out to her.",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "origClipLength": 108,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "邪魔をしてごめん。もうじき門限だよ",
                    "enText": "<size=38>Don't mean to interrupt, but curfew's soon.</size>",
                    "nextBlock": 4
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 119,
                    "pathId": 8267843030222473523
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 119,
                    "pathId": 7973623342648224378
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -3475132167214761860,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ネオユニヴァース",
            "enName": "Neo Universe",
            "jpText": "もう少しだけ……“交信”したい。",
            "enText": "I only want to… Communicate a little longer.",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "origClipLength": 65,
            "voiceIdx": 79,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 108,
                    "pathId": 278989232895093807
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 47,
                    "pathId": -8616553019422563183
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 76,
                    "pathId": 3029556763382262749
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -7778430997633497279,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ネオユニヴァース",
            "enName": "Neo Universe",
            "jpText": "“エーテル粒子”のおかげ……減衰率が低減。\n“特異点”の向こうの声、よく聴こえる。",
            "enText": "The Etheric Particles have… weakened \nattenuation. The voice coming from the \nSingularity can be heard clearly now.",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "origClipLength": 98,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -3024106823961545925
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 70,
                    "pathId": 1388901990148876132
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 109,
                    "pathId": 8050996110905731362
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -886193530232091697,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "“エーテル粒子”“特異点”は宇宙に関する\n用語だ。状況から察するに、彼女は宇宙に\nいる存在と“交信”しているつもりのようだ。",
            "enText": "I recognize these terms as astrophysical ones \nand conclude from the situation that she must \nbe \"communicating\" with some space entity.",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "origClipLength": 125,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "そっか、宇宙とか好きなんだな",
                    "enText": "I see. You really like space, don't you?",
                    "nextBlock": 7
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "そっか、宇宙とか好きなんだね",
                    "enText": "I see. You really like space, don't you?",
                    "nextBlock": 7
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 136,
                    "pathId": -4091883967635567927
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 136,
                    "pathId": -3981747581171542343
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -2219075717982300983,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ネオユニヴァース",
            "enName": "Neo Universe",
            "jpText": "ネオユニヴァースは“IRST”……。\n……あなたも宇宙……『好き』？",
            "enText": "Neo Universe is IRST… \nDo you… also Like space?",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "origClipLength": 89,
            "voiceIdx": 30,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 139,
                    "pathId": -1854468356789575023
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 75,
                    "pathId": 6742549524855204255
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 100,
                    "pathId": -7539176571247018869
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 4488409495618656668,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "持っていた映画のパンフに気づいたらしい。\n今日観てきた宇宙開拓物のSF映画だ。\nその感想もまじえつつ――",
            "enText": "She seems to have noticed the small movie \npamphlet I was still holding. It was about \nthe space exploration movie I just watched. \nMy mind half distracted by this, I said…",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "origClipLength": 112,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "外宇宙進出には夢があるよな！",
                    "enText": "<size=38>Setting off into outer space is so enthralling!</size>",
                    "nextBlock": 10
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "外宇宙進出には夢があるよね！",
                    "enText": "<size=38>Setting off into outer space is so enthralling!</size>",
                    "nextBlock": 10
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "宇宙人とも力を合わせるって、素敵だよな",
                    "enText": "I love the idea of cooperating with aliens.",
                    "nextBlock": 13
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "宇宙人とも力を合わせるって、素敵だよね",
                    "enText": "I love the idea of cooperating with aliens.",
                    "nextBlock": 13
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 139,
                    "pathId": -5506211164687514487
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 123,
                    "pathId": -1111837820912588511
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 123,
                    "pathId": 7379408681747440324
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -5542283086355618758,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "持っていた映画のパンフに気づいたらしい。\n今日観てきた宇宙開拓物のSF映画だ。\nその感想もまじえつつ――",
            "enText": "She seems to have noticed the small movie \npamphlet I was still holding. It was about \nthe space exploration movie I just watched. \nMy mind half distracted by this, I said…",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "origClipLength": 112,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "外宇宙進出には夢があるよな！",
                    "enText": "<size=38>Setting off into outer space is so enthralling!</size>",
                    "nextBlock": 10
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "外宇宙進出には夢があるよね！",
                    "enText": "<size=38>Setting off into outer space is so enthralling!</size>",
                    "nextBlock": 10
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "宇宙人とも力を合わせるって、素敵だよな",
                    "enText": "I love the idea of cooperating with aliens.",
                    "nextBlock": 13
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "宇宙人とも力を合わせるって、素敵だよね",
                    "enText": "I love the idea of cooperating with aliens.",
                    "nextBlock": 13
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 139,
                    "pathId": -5463112230412259210
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 123,
                    "pathId": -7790694149971743275
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 123,
                    "pathId": 5520998536937610557
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -5610333777513463892,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "外の世界、未踏の世界。無限に広がる\n宇宙への憧れがもたらす出会いは、\nきっと素敵なものだからと伝える。",
            "enText": "A whole other world, still unexplored \nand unknown. An endless universe \nand exciting new encounters. It's such \nan appealing concept.",
            "nextBlock": 11,
            "origClipLength": 111,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 139,
                    "pathId": 7183857173177064435
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 123,
                    "pathId": 3449267691467904673
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 122,
                    "pathId": 8017020421953635497
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -8891219813650745896,
            "blockIdx": 10
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ネオユニヴァース",
            "enName": "Neo Universe",
            "jpText": "……。\nみんなの存在、感じてみたい？",
            "enText": "…Do you want to feel… their presence?",
            "nextBlock": 12,
            "origClipLength": 68,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "……え？",
                    "enText": "…Wuh?",
                    "nextBlock": 12
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 8498261484100774433
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 40,
                    "pathId": 7023391047017445243
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 79,
                    "pathId": -4829920917697862257
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 1113874266491755576,
            "blockIdx": 11
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ネオユニヴァース",
            "enName": "Neo Universe",
            "jpText": "目を……閉じて。",
            "enText": "Close… your eyes.",
            "nextBlock": 16,
            "origClipLength": 55,
            "voiceIdx": 90,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 25,
                    "pathId": -1991100381299806925
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 66,
                    "pathId": -340911499985537643
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 4217122562472597608,
            "blockIdx": 12
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "映画では別の星の人間とだって協力していた。\n理解が及ばなかった相手とも心を通わせれば、\nどんなことだってできるはずだからと伝える。",
            "enText": "That's exactly what had happened in \nthe movie. Anything is possible as long \nas you reach out to one another, even if \nnot through words.",
            "nextBlock": 14,
            "origClipLength": 129,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 148,
                    "pathId": 5866125784790723254
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 158,
                    "pathId": 5399985572108256976
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 140,
                    "pathId": 9188220239377319006
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -3940777989695844949,
            "blockIdx": 13
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ネオユニヴァース",
            "enName": "Neo Universe",
            "jpText": "今ならその気持ち、伝えられるよ。",
            "enText": "You could convey those feelings… right now.",
            "nextBlock": 15,
            "origClipLength": 65,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "……え？",
                    "enText": "…Wuh?",
                    "nextBlock": 15
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 1604476344657729403
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 37,
                    "pathId": -3180712170831512980
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 76,
                    "pathId": -8621122119230674031
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 6493761318180270848,
            "blockIdx": 14
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ネオユニヴァース",
            "enName": "Neo Universe",
            "jpText": "目を……閉じて。",
            "enText": "Close… your eyes.",
            "nextBlock": 16,
            "origClipLength": 55,
            "voiceIdx": 90,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 25,
                    "pathId": -7540574396081461776
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 66,
                    "pathId": -1199431513857277495
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -3574721399683539805,
            "blockIdx": 15
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ネオユニヴァース",
            "enName": "Neo Universe",
            "jpText": "“コネクト”……。\n心で“ハロー、ハロー”だよ。",
            "enText": "Connect… Send a \"Hello, hello\" \nfrom the heart.",
            "nextBlock": 17,
            "origClipLength": 76,
            "voiceIdx": 74,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "……ハロー……ハロー……？",
                    "enText": "…Hello… hello?",
                    "nextBlock": 17
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 16,
                    "pathId": -5166884153531633797
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 16,
                    "pathId": -6764144341210855472
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 5155462294729761842,
            "blockIdx": 16
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "呼びかけのあと頭の中に\n鈴の音のような音が鳴ったように感じ――",
            "enText": "Upon speaking those words, a sound not \nunlike a bell's rung in my head.",
            "nextBlock": 18,
            "origClipLength": 85,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "pathId": -1181022894363255105,
            "blockIdx": 17
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "目を閉じていたはずなのに、\n意識の中には不思議な光景が広がっていた。",
            "enText": "Though my eyes were closed, an incredible \nscene unfolded in front of me.",
            "nextBlock": 19,
            "origClipLength": 89,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "う、宇宙！？何で？公園にいたのに……！？",
                    "enText": "O-Outer space!? How? I was in a park…!",
                    "nextBlock": 19
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 173,
                    "pathId": -636184734137637197
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 168,
                    "pathId": -1616075422159496600
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 5559385897981263298,
            "blockIdx": 18
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ネオユニヴァース",
            "enName": "Neo Universe",
            "jpText": "ここは……“観測”の入口。\nネオユニヴァースが、“NAV”した。\nだから大丈夫、だよ。",
            "enText": "This… is the gateway to Observation. \nNeo Universe provided NAV. Do not fear.",
            "nextBlock": 20,
            "origClipLength": 101,
            "voiceIdx": 47,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 30,
                    "pathId": -2422061642243634859
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 112,
                    "pathId": -5455036575043267911
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 112,
                    "pathId": 7034786000232790176
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 4813055531598123934,
            "blockIdx": 19
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "宇宙を漂う中、どこの言葉とも判別できない、\n声のような何かが頭の中に流れ込んでくる。",
            "enText": "I floated through space, unable to discern \nany words in the voice-like noises streaming \nthrough my head.",
            "nextBlock": 21,
            "origClipLength": 99,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "で、でも変な声みたいなのまで聞こえて……",
                    "enText": "B-But I'm uh, hearing strange voices…",
                    "nextBlock": 21
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 110,
                    "pathId": 9194177374582971772
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 110,
                    "pathId": 3502286319735968591
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -7439416538867468282,
            "blockIdx": 20
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ネオユニヴァース",
            "enName": "Neo Universe",
            "jpText": "“FELT”……。\n言葉がわからなくても……伝わる。\nあなたの想いも、伝わってる。",
            "enText": "FELT… Meaning can be conveyed… \nwithout words. The same is true… \nfor your own thoughts.",
            "nextBlock": 22,
            "origClipLength": 98,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 80,
                    "pathId": 4698189492666315457
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 109,
                    "pathId": -1415820118842777087
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -4404632898902956478,
            "blockIdx": 21
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "不思議な感覚だった。何を言われているのか\nわからないのに、彼女の言うとおり、\n友愛のような感情を確かに感じる。",
            "enText": "It was a strange sensation. Even though \nI couldn't understand anything, I definitely \nfelt something akin to friendship, just like \nshe said.",
            "nextBlock": 23,
            "origClipLength": 116,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "これが……君の言っていた“交信”……？",
                    "enText": "<size=36>Is this… what you're calling Communication…?</size>",
                    "nextBlock": 23
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "これが……貴方の言っていた“交信”……？",
                    "enText": "<size=36>Is this… what you're calling Communication…?</size>",
                    "nextBlock": 23
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 127,
                    "pathId": -1173002941669614117
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 127,
                    "pathId": 4784536203384114675
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -7685945353478917267,
            "blockIdx": 22
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "言葉も通じない相手とだってわかりあえる。\nそんなSF映画のような可能性を垣間見た\nような気がした……。",
            "enText": "Conversing without the boundaries \nof words… It was like being in one of \nthose science fiction movies for a bit.",
            "nextBlock": 24,
            "origClipLength": 111,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 231,
                    "pathId": 2573763264845869651
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 122,
                    "pathId": -6839193374103273843
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -6452945223792580533,
            "blockIdx": 23
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "額に押し当てられた指が離れる感覚とともに\n意識が元に戻る。\nそこは宇宙空間ではなく、元いた公園だった。",
            "enText": "With the removal of her finger from my \nforehead, I returned to a normal state \nof consciousness. Before me laid not \nouter space, but the park we were in.",
            "nextBlock": 25,
            "origClipLength": 111,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "今のは一体……夢……？",
                    "enText": "Was that… some kind of dream…?",
                    "nextBlock": 25
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 177,
                    "pathId": 1847501764260776521
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 174,
                    "pathId": 4041993391407602768
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -3494964581129004361,
            "blockIdx": 24
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ネオユニヴァース",
            "enName": "Neo Universe",
            "jpText": "“LMT”……。\nネオユニヴァースと、帰ろう。",
            "enText": "LMT… Let's go back together.",
            "nextBlock": 26,
            "origClipLength": 75,
            "voiceIdx": 74,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 50,
                    "pathId": 2845920974621938006
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 86,
                    "pathId": 7229997838630942410
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 8145227960005010353,
            "blockIdx": 25
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "気がつけば寮の門限が迫っていた。\nどこか楽しげなネオユニヴァースを連れ、\n慌てて帰路についたのだった。",
            "enText": "It was real close to curfew now. I headed \nback to the Academy with Neo Universe, who \nappeared rather cheerful, in a slight panic.",
            "nextBlock": -1,
            "origClipLength": 111,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 122,
                    "pathId": 3441517424594117898
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 122,
                    "pathId": 6143094748919294530
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -3688142904598352574,
            "blockIdx": 26
        }
    ],
    "modified": 1778807373,
    "humanTl": true
}